Subject: Big-endian: S6/S4 swaps as functions compiled on every host; open-park hook

ByteSwapS6Data/ByteSwapS4Data (RCT2.h, RCT1.h) hold the swap of the raw
SC6/SV6 and SC4/SV4 structs; the importers call them on big-endian hosts
only (if constexpr), so the swap tables build and can be checked on any
host. simulate: OPENRCT2_SIMULATE_OPEN_PARK opens the park first.

